Checks unambiguous macro parameter tokens: the 16/17 boundary that used
to replace parameter 1, all 476 ordinary parameters concatenated, radix
transitions, empty substitutions, attributes, argument count, all arguments,
and internal labels. Expected bytes are specified independently of ASL.
The expected stream is AB, 476 letters cycling A..Z, word $01dc,
ABZZ, word $0001, Z, and the invocation label address as word $01e2.
